@startuml HU03_Visualizar_Marketplace
title HU-03 — Visualizar Marketplace\nRefactorización DIP + SRP + Adapter Oracle (Sprint 1 · DeFi360)

skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 2
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #2E75B6
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #EBF3FB
skinparam noteBorderColor #F0A500
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFF8E1

actor       "Usuario"                  as User
participant "MarketplaceComponent\n<<React>>" as UI
participant "MarketplaceController"    as MC
participant "OfertaQueryService"       as OQS
participant "<<interface>>\nIPriceOracle"     as IPO
participant "SimulatedOracleAdapter"   as SOA
participant "OracleService\n(externo)" as OS

autonumber

note over MC, IPO
  T-04: MarketplaceController depende de IPriceOracle (DIP + OCP).
  T-05: OfertaQueryService centraliza la lógica de filtrado (SRP).
  T-06: MarketplaceComponent recibe datos tipados via props, sin import directo de OracleService.
end note

User -> UI : Navega a /marketplace\n{ filtros: colateral, tasa, plazo }

UI -> MC : GET /marketplace\n?colateral=ETH&tasaMax=5&plazo=30

MC -> OQS : getOfertas(filtros)
note right of MC
  T-05: Lógica de filtrado
  delegada a OfertaQueryService.
  Controller solo orquesta.
end note
activate OQS

OQS -> OQS : aplicarFiltros(colateral, tasaMax, plazo)
OQS --> MC  : List<OfertaLending>

MC -> IPO : getCurrentPrice(colateral)
note right of MC
  T-04: Constructor Injection:
  MarketplaceController(IPriceOracle oracle)
end note
activate IPO

IPO -> SOA : getCurrentPrice(colateral)
activate SOA

alt Ambiente de prueba / simulado
    SOA --> IPO : PriceData { asset, price, timestamp }
else Ambiente producción (futuro)
    SOA -> OS   : fetchPrice(colateral)
    OS  --> SOA : rawPrice
    SOA --> IPO : PriceData normalizado
end

deactivate SOA
IPO --> MC : PriceData
deactivate IPO

MC --> UI : MarketplaceDTO { ofertas, precio }
note right of UI
  T-06: Props tipadas (interface TypeScript).
  Sin imports de OracleService en UI.
end note

UI --> User : Renderizado de ofertas\ncon precios actualizados

deactivate OQS

note over User, OS
  OCP garantizado: cambiar Oracle real ↔ simulado
  no requiere modificar MarketplaceController ni MarketplaceComponent.
end note

@enduml
